    "faq": {
      "type": "bulk-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need a license or application?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Bulk pricing is open to everyone. Discounts apply automatically in your cart — no reseller license, no application, and no code to enter.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do the discounts work?",
            "answer": "<p>By the bag, your discount climbs with total weight — about 3 lb saves 5%, 6 lb saves 10%, 10 lb saves 15%, and 20 lb saves 20%. Mix half-pound and full-pound bags however you like; the reward meets at the same weight. Our 5 lb bulk bag — offered in both ground and paste — carries a standing price that drops the more bags you take.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I stack bulk pricing with a subscription?",
            "answer": "<p>No — they don't combine. Bulk pricing is its own reward. Subscribe &amp; Save is a separate path: if you only need a bag or two, you can still take 15% off by committing to a three-month subscription instead.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does shipping work?",
            "answer": "<p>Orders ship from Grass Valley, California, usually within 2–3 business days, and shipping is free on orders over $100. Past 25 lb, freight changes as the price comes down — so we set those orders up with you directly. Reach out at support@pachamana.com and we'll organize a price that works for you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I want to resell — is bulk for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Bulk pricing is for personal and ceremonial use. If you plan to resell or stock a store, our wholesale program gives you partner pricing and support — <a href=\"/pages/wholesale\">apply on the wholesale page</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
